"text":"Ìwọ ta òróró sí mi ní orí;","poem":1},{"text":"ago mí sì kún àkúnwọ́sílẹ̀.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Nítòótọ́, ìre àti àánú ni yóò máa tọ̀ mí lẹ́yìn","poem":1},{"text":"ní ọjọ́ ayé è mi gbogbo,","poem":2},{"text":"èmi yóò sì máa gbé inú ilé Olúwa","poem":1},{"text":"títí láéláé.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/yor_bib/PSA/23.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/yor_bib/PSA/24.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/yor_bib/PSA/22.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}